## Descriptions

### Short Description (≤ 80 chars)
Complete pharmacy management: POS, inventory, prescriptions, patients, analytics.

### Long Description (≤ 10,000 chars)
Pharmacy Suite is a comprehensive, offline-first pharmacy management system designed for independent and multi-location pharmacies.

**Core Features:**
- **Point of Sale (POS)**: Fast checkout with barcode scanning, insurance copay calculation, split payments, refunds, and shift management
- **Inventory Management**: Real-time stock tracking, expiry alerts, reorder thresholds, vendor management, purchase orders, receiving logs
- **Prescription Management**: Rx processing, SIG codes, drug interactions, refill tracking, compound prescriptions, prior authorizations
- **Patient Management**: Demographics, insurance profiles, allergy tracking, prescription history, custom fields
- **Analytics & Reporting**: Sales dashboards, demand forecasting, audit trails, expiry reports, controlled substance logs
- **Label Engine**: Custom label designer with barcode/QR support, template system, batch printing

**Technical Highlights:**
- **Offline-First**: Full functionality without internet; LAN sync for multi-terminal deployments
- **Data Sovereignty**: All data stored locally on your device/network — no cloud dependency
- **HIPAA-Ready**: Encryption at rest (AES-256), TLS 1.3 for LAN, tamper-evident audit logs
- **Multi-Terminal**: Main server + client terminals with merge-sync conflict resolution
- **Regulatory Compliance**: DEA schedules, controlled substance tracking, audit trails, state board reporting

**Who It's For:**
- Independent retail pharmacies
- Hospital outpatient pharmacies
- Long-term care pharmacies
- Compounding pharmacies
- Multi-location chains

**Requirements:**
- Windows 10/11 (x64)
- 4 GB RAM minimum (8 GB recommended)
- 2 GB disk space + data
- Local network for multi-terminal

**Support:** https://github.com/pharmacysuite/pharmacysuite/issues
**Privacy Policy:** https://pharmacysuite.github.io/privacy-policy

